/ActualText (OBJECTIVE\nTo contribute effectively to a progressive organization by applying my technical knowledge, analytical abilities, and leadership skills, while embracing new challenges and opportunities for growth.\n\nEXPERIENCE\nMaeko Tech Solution LLP | Software Developer December 2023 \023 Present\nWorking as a contractor with Skyworks as part of the Middleware Team, supporting enterprise integration and data workflows.\nDeveloped and maintained Azure Data Factory \(ADF\) pipelines for data transfer, transformation, and integration between Azure SQL and MSSQL/ODS databases.\nWorked with Azure Portal, Logic Apps, and API Management \(APIM\) for enterprise application integration and backend workflows.\nLead development of Android applications using Java and Kotlin, focusing on enterprise-grade solutions like the AMS \(Attendance Management System\).\nImplemented complex Offline-First architecture using SQLite, ensuring seamless data synchronization once internet connectivity is restored.\nDeveloped core modules for location tracking, automated QR scanning, and attendance logging using Volley for API integrations.\nUtilized Python \(Django\) for backend logic and data structure optimization for mobile-to-server communication.\nDesigned and maintained responsive web interfaces using HTML5, CSS3, and JavaScript.\n\nSKILLS\nLanguages: Java, Python, PHP, JavaScript, SQL.\nCloud & Data Integration: Azure Data Factory \(ADF\), Azure Portal, Azure Logic Apps, Azure API Management \(APIM\).\nMobile Development: Android Studio, SQLite, Volley.\nWeb Development: Django, Laravel, HTML5, CSS3.\nTools: Figma \(UI/UX Design\), GitHub,Postman VS Code.\(\nPROJECTS\nSkyworks \023 Middleware & Data Integration Platform\nRole: Middleware / Azure Developer \(Contractor\)\nDeveloped and maintained Azure Data Factory \(ADF\) pipelines for data integration and transfer between Azure SQL, MSSQL, and ODS databases.\nDesigned and monitored data workflows using ADF pipelines, datasets, linked services, and triggers.\nWorked with Azure Logic Apps to develop and maintain enterprise integration workflows and automate backend processes.\nDeveloped and configured Azure API Management \(APIM\) APIs for exposing backend services and stored procedures through secure REST endpoints.\nWorked with Azure Portal for deployment, configuration, monitoring, troubleshooting, and managing cloud resources.\nIntegrated APIs with SQL databases and implemented data transformation, validation, and error-handling workflows.\nTroubleshot production and QA issues related to ADF pipelines, Logic Apps, APIM APIs, SQL queries, and data transfers.\nCollaborated with the Middleware team to resolve production tickets and support application and data integration requirements.\n\nAMS QR \(Attendance Management System\) | Android App\nDeveloped an end-to-end attendance system featuring QR code scanning and background data synchronization.\n\nAMS FACE \(Attendance Management System\) | Android App\nCurrently implementing a face recognition feature to mark attendance.\n\nKansara Nayati | Web & Android Application\nDesigned a community information platform using PHP Laravel and MySQL, providing real-time data access for community members.\n)
