/ActualText (Sakal | School Management System\nBuilding an Android teacher app to mark attendance and upload student information for class teachers.\n\nSaathi\nWorking on enhancements as per client requirements.\n\nGurukul Template | Web App\nCreated a template-based image generation tool allowing users to customize posters, certificates, and event creatives, add text/images, and export high-quality downloadable graphics.\(\nEDUCATION\nMCA \(Master of Computer Applications\) | Mohan Lal Sukhadia University, Udaipur\(2023\) \023 7.76 CGPA\n\nB.Sc. | Bhupal Nobles' University, Udaipur\(2021\) \023 66.51%\n\n12th  | Mahaveer Public Sr. Sec. School, Rishabhdeo\(2018\)-71.6%\n\n10th  | Mahaveer Public Sr. Sec. School, Rishabhdeo\(2018\)- 7.8 CGPA\n\nCERTIFICATIONS\nDjango Full Stack Development \023 Udemy )
